  "details": "This is happening in the build that is to this day (31st July 2019 11.45pm CEST, Cant rememver build number)\n\nSometimes it comes after just 5 minutes of joining a world. But can also happen hours later. Basically you start to see the avatars \"lag around\" fx. When someone runs its like its going 1 fps BUT voices is not desynced i can hear everyone fine. You hear them talk but when you talk back they are somewhere else.. But you dont see that = DeSync. The game isnt lagging. Its just DeSync. It happens all the time for me. \n\nWill post a log as soon as it happens again.",
